  "description": "\\*\\*Original Webtoon:\\*\\* \\[Daum\\](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B6%88%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84/3630), \\[KakaoPage\\](https://page.kakao.com/content/62371259) 10 years after the incident. Nothing has changed yet, and people's distrust of the law and system continues to grow. And at that time, the high-tech artificial intelligence judge 'Eve' appeared like a comet. Introduced as a presidential pledge, she gains great interest and popularity with her fair and strict judgment, as if to repay the people's expectations. Then one day, Eve suddenly disappeared from the server. And a week later, a video message arrives on everyone's smartphone. The main character in the video... was Eve, who had disappeared. \"From now on, once a week, I will eradicate injustices in our society.\" She declares that she will judge those who are unfair beyond the control of the law and system, and the mysterious helpers who help her. And the people in favor of or against it, and those who tremble with anxiety... What is Eve's real purpose and why she did this?",
